      "description": "Public-site Bootstrap variant with the existing uppercase Oswald label and state colors.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-download\">Download emuStudio</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-download{display:inline-block;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:.25rem;padding:.375rem .75rem;font-family:Oswald,sans-serif;font-size:1rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s ease-in-out,background-color .15s ease-in-out,border-color .15s ease-in-out,box-shadow .15s ease-in-out;background:#17a2b8;border-color:#17a2b8;padding:.5rem 1rem;font-size:1.25rem;border-radius:.3rem;}.ds-button-download:hover{background:#138496;border-color:#117a8b}.ds-button-download:focus,.ds-button-download:focus-visible{outline:0;background:#138496;border-color:#117a8b;box-shadow:0 0 0 .2rem rgba(58,176,195,.5)}.ds-button-download:active{background:#117a8b;border-color:#10707f}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-download{transition:none}}"
    },
